@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@customerToken = paste-customer-accessToken
@adminToken = paste-admin-accessToken
@packageId = 1
@addressId = 1
@orderId = 1
@purchaseId = 1
@purchaseLineId = 1
@receiptId = 1

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Register customer
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"customer01@example.com","password":"MyPassword123!","fullName":"Nguyễn Văn A"}

### Login - copy accessToken to customerToken above
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"customer01@example.com","password":"MyPassword123!"}

### Products (IDs must come from API responses, not assumed)
GET {{base}}/catalog/products?page=0&size=20&sort=priceAsc

### Address
POST {{base}}/me/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipient":"Nguyễn Văn A","phone":"0900000000","province":"TP.HCM","district":"","ward":"","street":"123 Nguyễn Trãi","isDefault":true}

### Create supplier first (admin); copy returned ID into supplier-product and purchase bodies
POST {{base}}/management/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ten":"Nhà cung cấp thử nghiệm","trang_thai":"HOP_TAC"}

### Link supplier to product before creating a purchase (admin)
POST {{base}}/management/supplier-products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nha_cung_cap_id":1,"san_pham_id":1,"gia_nhap_tham_khao":8000}

### Create purchase (admin/staff)
POST {{base}}/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"supplierId":1,"items":[{"packageId":{{packageId}},"quantity":100,"unitCost":8000}]}

### Approve purchase (admin only)
PATCH {{base}}/purchases/{{purchaseId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"DA_DUYET"}

### Draft receipt
POST {{base}}/purchases/{{purchaseId}}/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"purchaseLineId":{{purchaseLineId}},"quantity":100,"actualCost":8000}]}

### Confirm receipt - now stock increases
POST {{base}}/receipts/{{receiptId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Set cart item quantity (absolute, not increment)
PUT {{base}}/cart/items/{{packageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity":2}

### Checkout
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"addressId":{{addressId}},"paymentMethod":"COD","note":"Gọi trước khi giao"}

### Confirm sale - now stock decreases and invoice is generated
PATCH {{base}}/staff/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"DANG_CHUAN_BI"}

### Customer invoice
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
